			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 105000301,
					"content": "就是這個，就是這個！我還以為永遠都見不到它了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000302,
					"content": "#居然真的找到了，{F#妳}{M#你}們挺厲害的嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000303,
					"content": "朱老闆，像這種珍貴的東西，一定要好好保管，下次可能就沒這麼好運了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000304,
					"content": "沒錯沒錯，要是弄丟了我母親送我的這第二百五十三個戒指，我都不知道怎麼回家交待。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000305,
						105000306,
						105000307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000305,
					"content": "…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000308,
					"content": "哦，可能有些小誤會。我家裡有三座玉石礦，家母為了讓我討個好媳婦，就準備了很多玉石首飾當傳家寶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000309,
					"content": "加起來大概有五百多件吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000310,
					"content": "那你為什麼還要在這裡開客棧啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000311,
					"content": "太早繼承了家業，難免會覺得單調和枯燥嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000312,
					"content": "#總之非常感謝{F#妳}{M#你}們，這是答應要給{F#妳}{M#你}們的摩拉，請一定收下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000313,
					"content": "那我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000314,
					"content": "那我就不客氣了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000315,
						105000316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000315,
					"content": "出手好快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000317
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000317,
					"content": "明明功勞和苦勞都是我們的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000318,
					"content": "弟子就要有弟子的樣子，怎麼能和師父邀功呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000319,
						105000321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000319,
					"content": "說得也對…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000320,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，不是說好「師徒」只是演戲而已嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000323,
					"content": "現在就要開始練習呀，不然到了蒙德就穿幫了。那個繼承者八成和我一樣，是非常聰明的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000324,
					"content": "咕咕咕——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000325,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000326,
					"content": "好像有什麼特別響亮的聲音？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000327,
					"content": "哦，對了，妳應該有一兩天都沒吃飯了吧？因為沒…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000328,
					"content": "嗚啊啊啊啊——！住嘴！住嘴！沒那回事！別管那個了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000329,
					"content": "——嗯！我突然覺得，這件事弟子確實也有功勞，乾脆用這筆錢請弟子吃頓好的吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000330,
					"content": "往北邊走有家<color=#00E1FFFF>「望舒客棧」</color>，聽說那裡的飯菜特別美味，我們就去那邊嚐嚐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000331,
					"content": "不用感謝我，這都是一個可靠的師父應該做的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000332,
					"content": "她說要請我們吃飯？！我沒聽錯吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000333,
						105000335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000333,
					"content": "「快追上去吧」，我替妳說了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000334
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000334,
					"content": "快追上去吧！有好吃的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105000335,
					"content": "「她真是個好人」，我替妳說了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105000336
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105000336,
					"content": "她真是個好人！嘿嘿，吃好吃的去啦！",
